{
  "$schema": "iswc-preview/v1",
  "tag": "iswc-drawer",
  "category": "layout",
  "title": "&lt;iswc-drawer&gt;",
  "titleHtml": false,
  "description": "Documentación y demos del componente iswc-drawer de InSoft.",
  "storageKey": "docs-iswc-drawer",
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "title": "Uso",
      "lede": "Panel que se desliza desde un borde del viewport (derecha, izquierda, arriba o abajo).\r\n          Ideal para menús, filtros y contenido secundario.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": "<iswc-button id=\"openDefault\">Abrir drawer (end)</iswc-button>",
          "equivNote": "placement define el eje; light-dismiss el cierre por backdrop.",
          "equivHtml": "<!-- ver diagrama de ramas -->",
          "equivFlow": "<iswc-flowchart open-on-click animation=\"flow\">\n  <script type=\"application/json\">\n  {\n    \"flowchart\": {\n      \"title\": \"iswc-drawer: placement\",\n      \"direction\": \"TB\",\n      \"nodes\": [\n        {\n          \"id\": \"q\",\n          \"label\": \"placement=?\",\n          \"shape\": \"diamond\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"a\",\n          \"label\": \"start / end → ancho\",\n          \"shape\": \"round\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"b\",\n          \"label\": \"top / bottom → alto\",\n          \"shape\": \"round\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"c\",\n          \"label\": \"light-dismiss?\",\n          \"shape\": \"diamond\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"d\",\n          \"label\": \"clic fuera cierra\",\n          \"shape\": \"stadium\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"e\",\n          \"label\": \"solo chrome / Escape\",\n          \"shape\": \"stadium\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"edges\": [\n        {\n          \"from\": \"q\",\n          \"to\": \"a\",\n          \"label\": \"lat\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"from\": \"q\",\n          \"to\": \"b\",\n          \"label\": \"vert\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"from\": \"a\",\n          \"to\": \"c\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"from\": \"b\",\n          \"to\": \"c\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"from\": \"c\",\n          \"to\": \"d\",\n          \"label\": \"si\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"from\": \"c\",\n          \"to\": \"e\",\n          \"label\": \"no\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n  </script>\n</iswc-flowchart>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<iswc-drawer id=\"drwDefault\" label=\"Drawer estándar\">\r\n          <p>Un drawer es una excelente manera de mostrar contenido adicional sin salir de la página actual.</p>\r\n          <div slot=\"footer\">\r\n            <iswc-button data-drawer=\"close\" variant=\"outlined\">Cancelar</iswc-button>\r\n            <iswc-button data-drawer=\"close\" color=\"brand\">Aceptar</iswc-button>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </iswc-drawer>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "code": "<iswc-drawer label=\"Drawer estándar\">\n  Contenido.\n  <div slot=\"footer\">\n    <iswc-button data-drawer=\"close\">Cancelar</iswc-button>\n  </div>\n</iswc-drawer>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "placements",
      "title": "Placements",
      "lede": "El atributo <code class=\"code\">placement</code> elige desde qué borde se desliza.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<div class=\"demo-stack\">\r\n          <iswc-button id=\"openEnd\">end (default)</iswc-button>\r\n          <iswc-button id=\"openStart\">start</iswc-button>\r\n          <iswc-button id=\"openTop\">top</iswc-button>\r\n          <iswc-button id=\"openBottom\">bottom</iswc-button>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <iswc-drawer id=\"drwEnd\" label=\"End\" placement=\"end\">\r\n          <p>Este drawer se desliza desde la derecha (default).</p>\r\n        </iswc-drawer>\r\n        <iswc-drawer id=\"drwStart\" label=\"Start\" placement=\"start\">\r\n          <p>Este drawer se desliza desde la izquierda.</p>\r\n        </iswc-drawer>\r\n        <iswc-drawer id=\"drwTop\" label=\"Top\" placement=\"top\">\r\n          <p>Este drawer se desliza desde arriba.</p>\r\n        </iswc-drawer>\r\n        <iswc-drawer id=\"drwBottom\" label=\"Bottom\" placement=\"bottom\">\r\n          <p>Este drawer se desliza desde abajo.</p>\r\n        </iswc-drawer>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "code": "<iswc-drawer placement=\"start\">…</iswc-drawer>\n<iswc-drawer placement=\"top\">…</iswc-drawer>\n<iswc-drawer placement=\"bottom\">…</iswc-drawer>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "size",
      "title": "Tamaño",
      "lede": "Ajusta <code class=\"code\">size</code> en el host. Se aplica al ancho o alto según el placement.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": "<iswc-button id=\"openWide\">Drawer ancho (50%)</iswc-button>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<iswc-drawer id=\"drwWide\" label=\"50%\" size=\"50%\">\r\n          <p>Este drawer ocupa siempre el 50% del viewport.</p>\r\n        </iswc-drawer>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "code": "<iswc-drawer size=\"50%\">…</iswc-drawer>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "no-header",
      "title": "Sin header",
      "lede": "<code class=\"code\">without-header</code> oculta el header y el botón de cerrar.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": "<iswc-button id=\"openNoHeader\">Abrir sin header</iswc-button>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<iswc-drawer id=\"drwNoHeader\" without-header>\r\n          <p>¡Mira mamá, sin header!</p>\r\n          <div slot=\"footer\">\r\n            <iswc-button data-drawer=\"close\" color=\"brand\">Cerrar</iswc-button>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </iswc-drawer>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "code": "<iswc-drawer without-header>…</iswc-drawer>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "light-dismiss",
      "title": "Light dismiss",
      "lede": "<code class=\"code\">light-dismiss</code> cierra al hacer click fuera del drawer.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": "<iswc-button id=\"openLD\">Abrir (click fuera cierra)</iswc-button>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<iswc-drawer id=\"drwLD\" label=\"Light dismiss\" light-dismiss>\r\n          <p>Haz click fuera del drawer para cerrarlo.</p>\r\n        </iswc-drawer>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "code": "<iswc-drawer light-dismiss>…</iswc-drawer>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "nav-example",
      "title": "Drawer de navegación",
      "lede": "Caso típico: menú lateral persistente.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": "<iswc-button id=\"openNav\">Menú</iswc-button>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<iswc-drawer id=\"drwNav\" placement=\"start\" label=\"Navegación\" size=\"280px\">\r\n          <nav style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.5em\">\r\n            <a href=\"#\" style=\"text-decoration:none\">Inicio</a>\r\n            <a href=\"#\" style=\"text-decoration:none\">Productos</a>\r\n            <a href=\"#\" style=\"text-decoration:none\">Clientes</a>\r\n            <a href=\"#\" style=\"text-decoration:none\">Reportes</a>\r\n            <a href=\"#\" style=\"text-decoration:none\">Configuración</a>\r\n          </nav>\r\n        </iswc-drawer>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "code": "<iswc-drawer placement=\"start\" label=\"Menú\" size=\"280px\">\n  <nav>…</nav>\n</iswc-drawer>"
        }
      ]
    },
